WEBVTT

00:00:00.005 --> 00:00:00.725
<v Stefan>Hallo Wolfgang.

00:00:00.965 --> 00:00:01.445
<v Wolfgang>Hallo Stefan.

00:00:01.745 --> 00:00:03.065
